Hue Sync Relay Community is an independent project.

This package contains its own Java controller, configuration tools and documentation.
HTTP Shortcuts, tvQuickActions, Android SDK tools and vendor firmware are separate
products, not bundled or relicensed by this package. Their names identify compatible
interfaces and referenced documentation; no endorsement is implied.

Implementation references:
- HTTP Shortcuts: https://github.com/Waboodoo/HTTP-Shortcuts
  Documentation: https://http-shortcuts.rmy.ch/
- Tasker plugin protocol: https://tasker.joaoapps.com/plugins-intro.html
- tvQuickActions documentation: https://tvdevinfo.com/tvquickactions/
- Philips Hue developer documentation: https://developers.meethue.com/
- Sync Box client/API registration reference:
  https://github.com/MadMonkey87/InnerCore.Api.HueSync
- openHAB Hue Sync binding: https://www.openhab.org/addons/bindings/huesync/
- Android developer tools/documentation: https://developer.android.com/

The original controller was checked through a private home-theater installation.
Private device configuration and credentials are deliberately excluded from this
public application and documentation. Runtime compatibility still requires testing
on the recipient's own devices and app versions.
